WEBVTT

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:34.680
That was refreshing.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:37.470
Now I'm ready to study hard tonight.

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:36.920
EPISODE 4:
WHAT SHE WANTS
FROM A GENIUS IS X

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:35.250
<i>I-I gained weight.</i>

00:02:35.960 --> 00:02:38.880
<i>Did I do anything
that would make me gain weight?</i>

00:02:39.180 --> 00:02:41.640
<i>Nothing comes to mind.</i>

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:51.440
POTATO CHIPS

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:48.930
Fuminocchi, snacks?

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:50.020
I have udon, too.

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:52.190
Yay! Sure, I'll have some!

00:02:56.780 --> 00:02:59.450
Thanks for all the snacks, you two.

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:01.660
This is really good!

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:03.570
I've got more.

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:07.870
I love snacks and udon!

00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:12.250
This is it!

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:14.840
Because I've been eating
between meals every day!

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:20.340
Both of you eat even more than me,

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:24.140
but as girls,
you should have more self-restraint.

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:29.600
Y-You don't gain any weight?

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:34.560
With Rizurin, she's the type
where all the nutrition goes to her boobs.

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:40.400
And I'm the type who can eat and eat,
but never gain weight.

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:44.280
In other words,
I've got nothing to worry about!

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:47.620
Ow! Ow! That hurts.

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:50.250
What is this? What kind of expression of love?

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:52.000
<i>I've made up my mind!</i>

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:55.750
<i>I'm done eating between meals!</i>

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:57.090
What's up?

00:03:58.130 --> 00:04:01.970
My little sister, Mizuki,
made too many cheese tarts.

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:06.350
<i>Cheese... tarts?</i>

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:10.850
R-Right now, I'm full, so...

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:13.560
you three eat them.

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:15.350
You sure?

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:17.520
Then we each get half, Rizurin.

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:21.690
Wait a second. Yours is 2.4 times
bigger than mine, Takemoto.

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:25.660
<i>Hang in there.
You can do it, Fumino Furuhashi!</i>

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:34.330
<i>If I just focus on my studies,
this temptation is nothing!</i>

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:37.380
THE NEXT DAY

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:38.790
Look!

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:43.260
I finally got to buy
the rare pudding that always sells out!

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:45.380
I've got enough for everyone, too!

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:53.100
<i>Um, the tangent formula is y - f(a)= f'(a).</i>

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:54.600
THE NEXT DAY, AFTER SCHOOL

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:57.690
- Your family's prototype dish?
- Yes.

00:04:57.690 --> 00:04:58.650
Eel udon?

00:04:58.650 --> 00:04:59.570
That's gorgeous!

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:07.490
<i>Cos squared o = pudding
- sin squared o x pudding...</i>

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:09.870
AND THE NEXT DAY

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:14.040
My little sister was at it again.

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:16.250
Your little sister is amazing!

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:24.220
<i>Pudding x squared + eel
- f(t) = udon a/b...</i>

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:27.470
FIVE DAYS LATER

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:29.720
<i>It doesn't make sense.</i>

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:34.560
<i>I've been working hard on my diet,
but haven't lost any weight.</i>

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:36.100
<i>Why?</i>

00:05:36.440 --> 00:05:38.150
Are you listening, Furuhashi?

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:39.900
Yeah!

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:43.280
Huh? It's just you and me?

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:47.280
Ogata had to work,
and Takemoto had to train.

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:48.740
They left a while ago.

00:05:49.240 --> 00:05:51.580
O-Oh.

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:56.080
Furuhashi, you haven't
been looking well lately.

00:05:56.790 --> 00:05:59.630
You don't want to get
another cold like last time.

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:01.090
Want to go to the infirmary?

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:05.670
D-Don't worry about me. I'm totally fine.

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:11.140
Well, you're not focused on your studies,
so I can't ignore that.

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:14.640
But, really, it's nothing.

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:15.720
I mean...

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:27.150
On a diet?

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:28.650
Yes.

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:32.870
<i>So is my little sister.
Why do girls want to lose weight so badly?</i>

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:35.660
For now...

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:38.370
This is all I have at the moment.

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:46.130
I can't, Yuiga! Put it away!

00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:48.590
Hey, Furuhashi.

00:06:49.090 --> 00:06:51.970
You don't look like you've
gained any weight to me.

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:53.510
So you should get enough to eat.

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:56.930
No! If I give in to temptation here

00:06:57.180 --> 00:07:01.600
some passerby will go,
"Hey, look at that fat water flea!"

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:05.610
And everyone will laugh at me!

00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:06.440
Too negative!

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:08.190
Just eat it!

00:07:08.190 --> 00:07:11.070
No! My tummy is in danger
of becoming a muffin top!

00:07:11.070 --> 00:07:13.950
Nonsense! You're perfectly thin!

00:07:14.450 --> 00:07:15.780
My clothes hide it!

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:19.870
Touch it for yourself!

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:32.890
<i>Is this... okay?</i>

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:34.850
H-Hurry up!

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:37.390
Um...

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:38.560
all right.

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:49.360
<i>I-I shouldn't be thinking about it
in a weird way.</i>

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:55.030
<i>Calm. Calm.</i>

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:03.210
<i>Her skin is so pale...</i>

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:10.970
<i>smooth and soft.</i>

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:14.890
<i>H-Huh? What is this situation?</i>

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:17.600
<i>I... I feel like...</i>

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:21.770
<i>I'm doing something perverted!</i>

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:27.980
U-Um... well?

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:29.980
“W-Well,” what?

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:32.320
I mean, you know, my stomach.

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:36.410
R-Right. Um...

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:39.540
that was dangerous.

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:49.710
Dangerous.

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:52.210
In danger of becoming a muffin top...

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:59.890
Look, Furuhashi, again, I'm sorry,
but you have the wrong idea.

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:07.270
By "dangerous," I meant, um,
the f-feeling...

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:11.730
I have to buy tonight's late-night snacks!

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:14.030
Wait right there!

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:22.870
SUPER

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:22.870
Thanks for waiting!

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:25.460
What the hell are you doing?

00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:27.210
Late-night snacks.

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:29.670
They're essential
for studying at night, you know?

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:31.090
What about your diet?

00:09:32.510 --> 00:09:34.470
Oh, come on, Yuiga.

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:37.840
When you focus on studying at night,
the brain uses sugar...

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:41.680
so no matter how much I eat,
I won't gain weight.

00:09:49.310 --> 00:09:52.730
<i>Result of our discussion: she's allowed
thin noodles for a late-night snack.</i>

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:57.280
<i>Apparently her weight went back to normal.</i>

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:09.790
I heard about it, Rizu Ogata.

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:15.590
What's the idea
of taking an exam in the humanities?

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:20.640
Who are you again?

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:25.270
I'm Sawako Sekijo,
the president of the Chemistry Club!

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:30.020
S-Sorry. I'm not good with names.

00:10:31.310 --> 00:10:33.860
You mean you have no interest in me,

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:36.240
eternally in second place
on math and science tests?

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:38.530
Well, you are my rival.

00:10:38.530 --> 00:10:43.700
And that's why I can't let you
move to humanities on my watch.

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:47.330
Sorry, but I've done my homework on you.

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:51.330
OGATA UDON

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:51.330
Nariyuki Yuiga...

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:56.170
he's the main culprit
behind your switch to humanities!

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:57.590
Isn't that right?

00:10:57.590 --> 00:10:59.880
Sekijo... is it?

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:02.050
What are you going on about?

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:06.640
OGATA UDON

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:06.640
You're in love with that guy, aren't you?

00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:09.190
So you're like, "I'll go
to the same university as him!"

00:11:09.190 --> 00:11:10.980
Talk about "sweet nothings."

00:11:10.980 --> 00:11:11.940
You're wrong.

00:11:12.810 --> 00:11:17.990
Using energy for something vague
like falling in love is the height of inefficiency.

00:11:18.360 --> 00:11:21.280
O-Oh. So I was wrong.

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:23.950
I could've sworn...

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:30.620
Well, Yuiga is coming to my house today,
so I have to get going.

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:33.290
Sure. Sorry to take up your time.

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:36.550
So you are in love with him, aren't you?

00:11:36.550 --> 00:11:39.380
Or are you claiming he's only
a friend who comes to your house?

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:44.350
True, he's more than a friend.

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:47.010
Yuiga is my teacher.

00:11:47.850 --> 00:11:50.600
OGATA UDON

00:11:54.650 --> 00:11:59.820
Um... you're Sekijo, right?
From the same science class?

00:12:00.070 --> 00:12:01.650
What are you doing here?

00:12:02.150 --> 00:12:06.580
I just happened to stop here
for a bite to eat. Ignore me.

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:09.160
<i>Like I can!</i>

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:11.790
<i>Nobody could ignore
a person slurping right in front of them!</i>

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:13.620
There is one.

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:15.460
<i>Rizu Ogata...</i>

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:19.050
<i>if you stubbornly insist you don't love him...</i>

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:21.970
<i>then I'll test the veracity of that myself!</i>

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:27.760
Yuiga.

00:12:28.100 --> 00:12:31.480
What type of girl do you like?

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:34.940
Wh-Why would you ask me that?

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:37.940
<i>There! What do you think, Rizu Ogata?</i>

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:41.400
<i>Since I brought that up,
you must be burning with curiosity!</i>

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:44.950
<i>Huh? Her hand hasn't stopped moving!</i>

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:50.450
I guess my type is someone
who would help support our family.

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:53.710
<i>And this one got all serious on me!</i>

00:12:53.710 --> 00:12:57.420
You'd want to go to the same university
as your girlfriend, right?

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:01.260
No, everyone should go
to the university they want to go to.

00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:07.390
NAMBA CURRY UDON
FRIED CHICKEN UDON
MEAT UDON
GRATED YAM UDON
TEMPURA UDON, BURDOCK UDON

00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:07.390
YAM AND KELP UDON
BROWN SEAWEED UDON
DEEP-FRIED TOFU UDON
EGG UDON

00:13:01.510 --> 00:13:04.380
Wh-Where is a good place for a first date?

00:13:04.380 --> 00:13:08.180
Somewhere you don't have to spend
much money, like a park.

00:13:08.180 --> 00:13:10.220
How many children do you want?

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:12.980
I would think about that
after becoming financially stable.

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:18.310
<i>Why isn't she perturbed?</i>

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:19.860
<i>You should care, at least a little!</i>

00:13:19.860 --> 00:13:22.110
<i>Otherwise, I'm making a fool of myself!</i>

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:26.860
<i>M-Maybe it's that.
I'm not sitting close enough to him.</i>

00:13:27.070 --> 00:13:29.580
<i>How close do I have to get?</i>

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:31.290
<i>I don't get it.</i>

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:34.620
<i>Why is she grilling me about myself?</i>

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:38.460
<i>Don't tell me this is that famous thing...</i>

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:42.880
<i>the phenomenon called popularity!</i>

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:46.050
<i>No way. Not me.</i>

00:13:46.050 --> 00:13:48.720
<i>There's no way a girl I met
for the first time today would...</i>

00:13:49.300 --> 00:13:52.060
I-I'd like to ask you another question.

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:55.600
<i>She's 100% interested in me!</i>

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:58.690
<i>For the first time in my life, a girl is into me!</i>

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:02.440
W-Wait! I barely even know you.

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:05.400
What are you talking about?
That has nothing to do with it!

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:07.200
Sekijo, Yuiga.

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:09.870
You're too noisy.

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:20.210
So there's nothing
between you and Rizu Ogata?

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:22.290
You don't give up.

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:26.720
I'm her tutor, nothing more and nothing less.

00:14:26.720 --> 00:14:32.300
I see. Then she really is interested
in studying the humanities.

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:36.270
Sekijo, you're actually a nice person.

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:38.310
What makes me so nice?

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:41.560
After all, you were worried
about Ogata's choice of major.

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:43.650
It's not that.

00:14:44.020 --> 00:14:46.240
It's for my own sake.

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:50.030
I mean, if she studies humanities,
I won't be able to get in there.

00:14:50.280 --> 00:14:53.910
You mean you want to go
to the same university as Ogata?

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:56.160
Wh-What? Something wrong with that?

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:59.210
If you want to become her friend,
you should just tell her.

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:01.000
I-I never said that!

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:02.670
Yuiga.

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:06.960
I checked my own assignment.

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:08.130
Let's see.

00:15:09.550 --> 00:15:12.340
48! You got about half right.

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:16.310
You've gotten the hang of it
since the midterm.

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:19.140
Um, can I see it, too?

00:15:20.020 --> 00:15:21.440
I don't mind.

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:26.440
<i>I don't think 48%
is something to be happy about...</i>

00:15:27.070 --> 00:15:31.570
<i>but for someone who's inept in everything
but science, she's working hard.</i>

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:35.910
<i>I guess I was out of line
saying she was doing it for love.</i>

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:39.460
Let's keep up this trend!

00:15:49.260 --> 00:15:53.220
P-Please stop treating me like a child.

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:54.430
Sorry. It was a reflex.

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:58.720
<i>What's this? It seems
I wasn't necessarily wrong after all.</i>

00:16:01.690 --> 00:16:02.940
<i>Prime number progression?</i>

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:06.440
<i>Just how shaken up was she?</i>

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:07.940
What?

00:16:07.940 --> 00:16:09.740
Nothing.

00:16:09.740 --> 00:16:13.740
I will say I'm still not convinced
you should study humanities!

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:18.040
See you.

00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:19.540
Hey, Sekijo!

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:25.170
I help Ogata study in the library
on Mondays and Wednesdays.

00:16:25.170 --> 00:16:27.250
If you feel like it, you could come watch.

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:31.170
OGATA UDON

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:31.170
Why would I do that?

00:16:32.010 --> 00:16:36.510
But it is possible that I
would run into her by chance there.

00:16:36.510 --> 00:16:37.720
By chance!

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:41.850
LIBRARY

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:44.810
Oh, what a coincidence! Just a coincidence!

00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:51.940
<i>Just a coincidence!</i>

00:16:56.570 --> 00:16:58.200
Uruka, you made it.

00:16:58.450 --> 00:17:00.490
- Are you okay?
- It's the sports tournament.

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:03.040
Sports tournament? When?

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:03.960
Today.

00:17:03.960 --> 00:17:06.330
So hurry up, and change!

00:17:06.330 --> 00:17:08.340
Sure, after I finish this.

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:13.090
It's unusual for you
to be on the verge of being tardy.

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:17.390
Yeah. Practice was so tough yesterday
that I slept like a log,

00:17:17.600 --> 00:17:20.430
so I was scrambling this morning.

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:25.810
<i>This sensation...</i>

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:28.770
<i>this refreshing feeling of freedom...</i>

00:17:31.570 --> 00:17:33.320
<i>I forgot to put on a bra!</i>

00:17:35.910 --> 00:17:38.280
Advantage Oka.

00:17:39.280 --> 00:17:42.240
Uruka, why are you wearing your jersey?

00:17:42.240 --> 00:17:43.700
O-Oh, no reason.

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:47.500
<i>I was rushed,
but that's no excuse for this stupidity.</i>

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:51.670
<i>If Nariyuki found out, I would just die!</i>

00:17:54.760 --> 00:17:56.630
<i>Oh, no way!</i>

00:17:57.430 --> 00:17:59.640
All right, both teams, bow to each other!

00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:01.560
Let's have a good game!

00:18:01.810 --> 00:18:04.730
<i>Why, of all people...</i>

00:18:04.730 --> 00:18:08.810
<i>W-Well, he can't tell
just by looking at me, right?</i>

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:11.900
Uruka!

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:15.070
Takemoto has the ball!

00:18:15.320 --> 00:18:17.450
Do we have somebody who can stop her?

00:18:21.870 --> 00:18:24.870
<i>Th-They're focused on me!</i>

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:28.120
<i>I feel like they're staring at my chest.</i>

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:31.040
<i>I can't move!</i>

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:34.420
<i>Huh? She's not even protecting the ball.</i>

00:18:37.510 --> 00:18:39.930
He stole the ball from Takemoto!

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:41.640
Yuiga is awesome!

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:44.060
<i>I blew it!</i>

00:18:44.560 --> 00:18:47.060
<i>Right now, I have to forget about my chest!</i>

00:18:47.180 --> 00:18:49.020
<i>Focus! Focus!</i>

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:51.310
She really is fast!

00:18:53.730 --> 00:18:55.820
<i>Anyway, I'll score as fast as possible.</i>

00:18:55.820 --> 00:18:56.900
<i>Oh, no, you don't!</i>

00:19:01.910 --> 00:19:03.990
Traveling! White ball!

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:10.750
What's wrong, Uruka?

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:12.380
You're not as energetic as usual.

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:14.710
Want some udon?

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:16.710
I-I'm fine.

00:19:16.710 --> 00:19:18.090
You okay for the second half?

00:19:18.550 --> 00:19:20.590
Yes, no problem.

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:22.390
I think... somehow...

00:19:22.390 --> 00:19:23.220
Takemoto!

00:19:23.970 --> 00:19:27.100
Hey! What? Right now, we're enemies!

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:29.100
No, I was just a little worried.

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:34.480
You always come alive
when you're playing sports,

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:38.860
but today you have no energy,
so maybe you're not feeling well?

00:19:39.610 --> 00:19:43.370
N-No, that's not it.

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:45.370
Oh. Good, then.

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:46.200
Later!

00:19:47.240 --> 00:19:50.460
<i>You always come alive
when you're playing sports.</i>

00:19:50.460 --> 00:19:51.790
<i>Everyone's counting on you.</i>

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:53.080
<i>You shine.</i>

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:55.090
<i>I love you.</i>

00:19:55.790 --> 00:19:58.130
Fuminocchi, Rizurin...

00:19:58.760 --> 00:20:02.930
for the second half,
we're gonna go all out and win it!

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:09.600
Another three-pointer from Takemoto!

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:11.100
Now it's tied up!

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:18.400
<i>Sh-She's tough!
What was her deal in the first half?</i>

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:22.570
This time for sure, I'll block you!

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:39.800
<i>I'm not embarrassed! I'm not embarrassed!</i>

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:44.760
Got it!

00:20:57.360 --> 00:20:59.070
Wh-Wha...

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:02.990
The game's over!

00:21:04.860 --> 00:21:06.780
<i>Did he realize? He realized it, right?</i>

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:10.200
<i>Although Nariyuki is dense
when it comes to stuff like this...</i>

00:21:10.790 --> 00:21:13.040
<i>Tell me he didn't notice!</i>

00:21:13.410 --> 00:21:14.250
Takemoto...

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:18.840
At home, my little sister feels like that.

00:21:19.090 --> 00:21:21.300
So... don't worry about it.

00:21:23.090 --> 00:21:24.630
He realized!

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:28.100
And what he said
didn't make me feel any better!

00:21:28.300 --> 00:21:32.020
Nariyuki, you idiot!

00:23:06.530 --> 00:23:07.360
I'm back!

00:23:09.990 --> 00:23:12.620
Brother, welcome home!

00:23:12.870 --> 00:23:17.330
We're having healthy weed porridge tonight.

00:23:22.630 --> 00:23:25.460
Mizuki, you're wearing one today, huh?

00:23:26.170 --> 00:23:27.050
Wha...

00:23:27.050 --> 00:23:28.840
What are you looking at?

00:23:29.510 --> 00:23:32.140
Brother has no tact!

00:23:32.140 --> 00:23:33.260
Nope!

00:23:35.760 --> 00:23:39.480
<i>Next time:
A Genius in the Forest Strays for X.</i>

00:23:35.970 --> 00:23:40.020
NEXT EPISODE:
A GENIUS IN THE FOREST
STRAYS FOR X
